    {
      "id": "blk_099d3cd5",
      "type": "note",
      "text": "”兔子“指残星会会长的“宠物”——用来在暗面搞破坏",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 1,
        "source_type": "注释",
        "source_row": 2,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0,
        "source_id": "row2#note"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_30e35280",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "自然诞生于拉海洛的群体性索诺拉，其形成原因暂未确证。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_398a1b5c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "该索诺拉受星炬学院中共鸣者们潜意识与外溢的频率影响，逐渐形成为学院的镜像投影，成为存在于学院的特殊现象。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a7cd8bbf",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "兔子会引导学院暗面的进入者，直面自己恐惧、逃避的一面。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a7a7f1bb",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "西格莉卡的事件后，学院中仍有部分学生、教授在暗面遇见了类似的困境。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e4bb1c5b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "每位学生进入星炬学院时，都怀揣着一颗真心。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0c512ccb",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "这些真心绝不该被污染。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    }
  ]
}